# D3-AN-006: Ionisation can change the method coverage of an organic acid
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v1 ethanol 0.001mol
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v2 ethanol 0.001mol
add v2 NaOH 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
chromatograph v1
chromatograph v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
